{"persona": {"her": "池雨眠，报喜不报忧、陪护事无巨细、累极反而更平静，底线：不习惯在外人面前掉眼泪、要安排不要空安慰", "me": "甘子川，家里有车白天弹性、做事列清单、话不多", "relationship_stage": "同小区邻居偏熟（互相帮过小忙，第一次深度打交道）"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "甘子川同小区住四年，家里有车，白天时间弹性，帮邻居搬过东西修过水管。他办事习惯列清单核完再办。", "her": "池雨眠的父亲因胆结石住院，腹腔镜手术排在11月10日上午，主刀是庾医生。她母亲10日傍晚从外地坐高铁到，弟弟池小隼在外地念大学，陪护主要靠她。", "warmth": "邻居两年多，她帮甘子川代收过半个月快递，甘子川给她带过两次饭，都是顺手事，没深聊过家里。", "style": "称呼甘哥，说话利落，报时间和地点精确到分钟，难过的事说到一半会自己掐断。", "lessons": "她问怎么办是要步骤；她说没事，往往是还没到能说的时候。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "甘哥，我爸明天上午做胆结石手术，腹腔镜，我今晚就在医院陪床。明早七点一刻你能不能开车来医院北门帮我搬一下？一箱日用品，我妈连夜收拾的，沉。", "ts": "2026-11-09 18:12"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "住院部八楼，电梯早上人多，有你搬省一半事。油费我给你算，别客气。", "ts": "2026-11-09 18:15"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "改了：查房说排第一台，八点半就进手术室。你七点来就行。那箱里有个保温杯，我妈灌了粥，别横放。", "ts": "2026-11-10 07:02"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "我爸十二点零五进去了，庾医生说两个钟头左右。走廊充电口就两个，全被占了。", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:38"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "你别问我觉得怎么样，我不想说这个。就问一句：护士站说E区停车场对陪护车辆免费，是真的吗？我妈下午四点二十到站，我去接人，车停哪儿合适？", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:41"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "我爸两点十八出来的，庾医生说很顺，引流管带两天，麻药劲儿过了会疼，不让乱动。我妈也到了，在楼下跟小隼视频，让他安心上课。", "ts": "2026-11-10 15:26"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "今天真是……行了不说了，你去忙吧，晚上我没事。", "ts": "2026-11-10 15:29"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "我爸睡了，我在走廊尽头这把椅子上坐着，医院的灯是真亮。", "ts": "2026-11-10 23:02"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "行了，你别回了，占你手机电量，你也早点睡。明早七点我来换班……不对，我根本没换班，我一直在这。", "ts": "2026-11-10 23:05"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "我爸早上喝了小半碗粥，说饿。护士说排气了是好事。对了，我妈的车昨天停E区，出岗亭没收费，看来护士站没说错。", "ts": "2026-11-11 08:12"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "她人已经到医院了，接站的事不用再管。", "ts": "2026-11-11 08:15"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "庾医生查房说周五能出院。出院小结、医保结算，还有租的轮椅要还三楼租借处。我爸非说自己能走，刚才下床走两步就扶墙，倔得跟我小时候一个样。", "ts": "2026-11-12 19:36"}, {"uid": 12, "role": "HER", "text": "出院手续办完了，结算窗口退了押金差额三百二，我爸非要自己揣兜里，说这叫战利品。", "ts": "2026-11-13 10:18"}, {"uid": 13, "role": "HER", "text": "轮椅还了，小票我收着。他现在在家躺着，就惦记晚饭要口软和的。", "ts": "2026-11-13 10:21"}, {"uid": 14, "role": "HER", "text": "我爸在家第一顿晚饭，嫌我炖的鲈鱼刺多，念叨三遍了，跟小时候一个样。我一边烦一边想笑。", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:04"}, {"uid": 15, "role": "HER", "text": "明天想给你带点东西，你想吃啥？别说你随便，挑一个。", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:07"}, {"uid": 16, "role": "HER", "text": "我妈让你别推辞，两条鲳鱼放你家门卫了，冰袋垫了两层。我爸非再加一袋他晒的鱼鲞，我拦不住。", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:24"}, {"uid": 17, "role": "HER", "text": "今天换药我请了半天假陪的。签字那天手抖的事一直没跟人说过，名字签得歪歪扭扭，护士看了我一眼，啥也没说。", "ts": "2026-11-15 20:58"}, {"uid": 18, "role": "HER", "text": "现在我爸好了，能说了。说出来也没什么，就是那天走廊里就我一个人。", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:01"}, {"uid": 19, "role": "HER", "text": "我爸今早自己下楼买的豆浆油条，庾医生电话里说恢复得好。我明天正常上班，欠班组的两个早班周末补回来。", "ts": "2026-11-16 08:36"}, {"uid": 20, "role": "HER", "text": "鲳鱼记得拿，别放坏了。这阵子谢谢你，回头你车保养，我认识一个实在的师傅。", "ts": "2026-11-16 08:39"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|甘哥，我爸明天上午做胆结石手术，腹腔镜，我今晚就在医院陪床。明早七点一刻你能不能开车来医院北门帮我搬一下？一箱日用品，我妈连夜收拾的，沉。|2026-11-09 18:12": 0, "HER|住院部八楼，电梯早上人多，有你搬省一半事。油费我给你算，别客气。|2026-11-09 18:15": 1, "HER|改了：查房说排第一台，八点半就进手术室。你七点来就行。那箱里有个保温杯，我妈灌了粥，别横放。|2026-11-10 07:02": 2, "HER|我爸十二点零五进去了，庾医生说两个钟头左右。走廊充电口就两个，全被占了。|2026-11-10 12:38": 3, "HER|你别问我觉得怎么样，我不想说这个。就问一句：护士站说E区停车场对陪护车辆免费，是真的吗？我妈下午四点二十到站，我去接人，车停哪儿合适？|2026-11-10 12:41": 4, "HER|我爸两点十八出来的，庾医生说很顺，引流管带两天，麻药劲儿过了会疼，不让乱动。我妈也到了，在楼下跟小隼视频，让他安心上课。|2026-11-10 15:26": 5, "HER|今天真是……行了不说了，你去忙吧，晚上我没事。|2026-11-10 15:29": 6, "HER|我爸睡了，我在走廊尽头这把椅子上坐着，医院的灯是真亮。|2026-11-10 23:02": 7, "HER|行了，你别回了，占你手机电量，你也早点睡。明早七点我来换班……不对，我根本没换班，我一直在这。|2026-11-10 23:05": 8, "HER|我爸早上喝了小半碗粥，说饿。护士说排气了是好事。对了，我妈的车昨天停E区，出岗亭没收费，看来护士站没说错。|2026-11-11 08:12": 9, "HER|她人已经到医院了，接站的事不用再管。|2026-11-11 08:15": 10, "HER|庾医生查房说周五能出院。出院小结、医保结算，还有租的轮椅要还三楼租借处。我爸非说自己能走，刚才下床走两步就扶墙，倔得跟我小时候一个样。|2026-11-12 19:36": 11, "HER|出院手续办完了，结算窗口退了押金差额三百二，我爸非要自己揣兜里，说这叫战利品。|2026-11-13 10:18": 12, "HER|轮椅还了，小票我收着。他现在在家躺着，就惦记晚饭要口软和的。|2026-11-13 10:21": 13, "HER|我爸在家第一顿晚饭，嫌我炖的鲈鱼刺多，念叨三遍了，跟小时候一个样。我一边烦一边想笑。|2026-11-14 21:04": 14, "HER|明天想给你带点东西，你想吃啥？别说你随便，挑一个。|2026-11-14 21:07": 15, "HER|我妈让你别推辞，两条鲳鱼放你家门卫了，冰袋垫了两层。我爸非再加一袋他晒的鱼鲞，我拦不住。|2026-11-15 15:24": 16, "HER|今天换药我请了半天假陪的。签字那天手抖的事一直没跟人说过，名字签得歪歪扭扭，护士看了我一眼，啥也没说。|2026-11-15 20:58": 17, "HER|现在我爸好了，能说了。说出来也没什么，就是那天走廊里就我一个人。|2026-11-15 21:01": 18, "HER|我爸今早自己下楼买的豆浆油条，庾医生电话里说恢复得好。我明天正常上班，欠班组的两个早班周末补回来。|2026-11-16 08:36": 19, "HER|鲳鱼记得拿，别放坏了。这阵子谢谢你，回头你车保养，我认识一个实在的师傅。|2026-11-16 08:39": 20}, "uid_seq": 21, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-09 18:25", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-10 12:50", "status": "explicit", "text": "答停车与接站安排，不追问她的情绪", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-10 15:35", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-10 23:12", "status": "explicit", "text": "不回复，让她安心休息", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-11 08:25", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-14 21:15", "status": "explicit", "text": "接住她的情绪松动，轻收不追问", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-15 15:30", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-09 18:25", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 5, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-10 07:12", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观点", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-10 12:50", "signal_hint": "拒绝", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m1", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 5, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-10 15:35", "signal_hint": "收尾", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "收尾", "action_allowed": false, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "无", "hook_delivered": null, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-10 23:12", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-11 08:25", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-12 19:45", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观点", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-13 10:30", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 4, "updates_applied": 2}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-14 21:15", "signal_hint": "含糊", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-15 15:30", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-15 21:10", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-16 08:45", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 5, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "甘子川同小区住四年，家里有车，白天时间弹性，帮邻居搬过东西修过水管。他办事习惯列清单核完再办。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "池雨眠的父亲因胆结石住院，腹腔镜手术排在11月10日上午，主刀是庾医生。她母亲10日傍晚从外地坐高铁到，弟弟池小隼在外地念大学，陪护主要靠她。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "邻居两年多，她帮甘子川代收过半个月快递，甘子川给她带过两次饭，都是顺手事，没深聊过家里。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "称呼甘哥，说话利落，报时间和地点精确到分钟，难过的事说到一半会自己掐断。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "甘子川，家里有车白天弹性、做事列清单、话不多", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "池雨眠，报喜不报忧、陪护事无巨细、累极反而更平静，底线：不习惯在外人面前掉眼泪、要安排不要空安慰", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "她父亲明天上午做胆结石腹腔镜手术", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家人病情", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸明天上午做胆结石手术，腹腔镜"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 18:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 18:25", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "她今晚在医院陪床", "subject": "HER", "relation": "安排", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["我今晚就在医院陪床"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-09 夜", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 18:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 18:25", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "她请我11月10日早上七点开车到医院北门帮忙搬一箱日用品（原为七点一刻，因手术排第一台提前）", "subject": "HER", "relation": "请求", "evidence_uids": [0, 2], "evidence_quotes": ["明早七点一刻你能不能开车来医院北门帮我搬一下？一箱日用品", "你七点来就行"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 07:15", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 07:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0009@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 18:25", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "她请我明早七点一刻开车到医院北门帮她搬一箱日用品", "valid_to": "2026-11-10 07:12", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "你七点来就行"}]}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "住院部在八楼，早上电梯人多", "subject": "HER", "relation": "地点", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["住院部八楼，电梯早上人多"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 18:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 18:25", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "她提出要给我算油费", "subject": "HER", "relation": "客气", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["油费我给你算，别客气"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 18:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 18:25", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "查房后她父亲的手术排第一台，八点半进手术室", "subject": "HER", "relation": "父亲手术安排", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["查房说排第一台，八点半就进手术室"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 08:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 07:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 07:12", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "她让我七点到医院北门", "subject": "HER", "relation": "搬东西的时间变更", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["你七点来就行"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 07:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 07:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 07:12", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "那箱日用品里有个保温杯，她妈灌了粥，不能横放", "subject": "HER", "relation": "物品交代", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["那箱里有个保温杯，我妈灌了粥，别横放"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 07:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 07:12", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "她爸十二点零五进手术室，庾医生说两个钟头左右", "subject": "HER", "relation": "父亲手术进展", "evidence_uids": [3, 5], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸十二点零五进去了，庾医生说两个钟头左右。", "我爸两点十八出来的，庾医生说很顺"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 12:05", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 12:50", "valid_to": "2026-11-10 15:35", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:50", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "她爸十二点零五进手术室，庾医生说两个钟头左右", "valid_to": "2026-11-10 15:35", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [5], "quote": "我爸两点十八出来的，庾医生说很顺"}]}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "走廊只有两个充电口，且都被占了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "陪护现场细节", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["走廊充电口就两个，全被占了。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 12:38", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 12:50", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:50", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "她妈下午四点二十到站，她去接人", "subject": "HER", "relation": "行程安排", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["我妈下午四点二十到站，我去接人"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 16:20", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 12:50", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:50", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "E区停车场对陪护车辆免费已核实：她妈的车昨天出岗亭未收费", "subject": "HER", "relation": "停车政策转述", "evidence_uids": [4, 9], "evidence_quotes": ["护士站说E区停车场对陪护车辆免费，是真的吗？", "我妈的车昨天停E区，出岗亭没收费"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 08:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0018@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:50", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "护士站说E区停车场对陪护车辆免费（未核实今天是否适用）", "valid_to": "2026-11-11 08:25", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [9], "quote": "我妈的车昨天停E区，出岗亭没收费"}]}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "她明确不想聊自己的感受", "subject": "HER", "relation": "沟通边界", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["你别问我觉得怎么样，我不想说这个。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 12:50", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 12:50", "history": []}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "她爸两点十八出手术室，庾医生说很顺，引流管带两天，麻药过了会疼、不让乱动", "subject": "HER", "relation": "父亲术后情况", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸两点十八出来的，庾医生说很顺，引流管带两天，麻药劲儿过了会疼，不让乱动。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 14:18", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 15:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 15:35", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "她妈已到医院，在楼下跟弟弟池小隼视频", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家属到场", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["我妈也到了，在楼下跟小隼视频，让他安心上课。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 15:26", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 15:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 15:35", "history": []}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "她说晚上没事", "subject": "HER", "relation": "当晚状态", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["你去忙吧，晚上我没事。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 晚上", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 15:35", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 15:35", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "她爸睡了，她在走廊尽头椅子上坐着", "subject": "HER", "relation": "陪护现场", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸睡了，我在走廊尽头这把椅子上坐着"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10 23:02", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 23:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 23:12", "history": []}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "她一直在医院，没有换班", "subject": "HER", "relation": "陪护安排", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["我根本没换班，我一直在这"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 23:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 23:12", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "她爸早上喝了小半碗粥，护士说排气了是好事", "subject": "HER", "relation": "父亲术后恢复", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸早上喝了小半碗粥，说饿。护士说排气了是好事。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11 早上", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 08:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 08:25", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "她妈的车昨天停E区，出岗亭没收费", "subject": "HER", "relation": "停车", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["我妈的车昨天停E区，出岗亭没收费"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-10", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 08:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 08:25", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "她妈已经到医院了，接站的事不用再管", "subject": "HER", "relation": "接站", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["她人已经到医院了，接站的事不用再管。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11 早上", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 08:25", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 08:25", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "庾医生查房说周五能出院", "subject": "HER", "relation": "父亲住院", "evidence_uids": [11, 12], "evidence_quotes": ["庾医生查房说周五能出院", "出院手续办完了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 19:45", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 10:30", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 19:45", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "庾医生查房说周五能出院", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 10:30", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [12], "quote": "出院手续办完了"}]}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "出院要办出院小结、医保结算，还要把租的轮椅还到三楼租借处", "subject": "HER", "relation": "出院流程", "evidence_uids": [11, 13], "evidence_quotes": ["出院小结、医保结算，还有租的轮椅要还三楼租借处", "轮椅还了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 19:45", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 10:30", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 19:45", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "出院要办出院小结、医保结算，还要把租的轮椅还到三楼租借处", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 10:30", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [13], "quote": "轮椅还了"}]}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "她爸坚持自己能走，下床走两步就扶墙", "subject": "HER", "relation": "父亲术后恢复", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸非说自己能走，刚才下床走两步就扶墙"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 19:45", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 19:45", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "周五可能出院，具体看情况", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["庾医生查房说周五能出院"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 19:45", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 19:45", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "她爸的出院手续办完了，结算窗口退了押金差额三百二", "subject": "HER", "relation": "出院结算", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["出院手续办完了，结算窗口退了押金差额三百二"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-13", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 10:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 10:30", "history": []}, "f_0033": {"fact_id": "f_0033", "text": "她爸把三百二押金差额自己揣兜里，说这叫战利品", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "她父亲", "evidence_uids": [12], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸非要自己揣兜里，说这叫战利品"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-13", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 10:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 10:30", "history": []}, "f_0034": {"fact_id": "f_0034", "text": "轮椅已还，小票她收着", "subject": "HER", "relation": "出院手续", "evidence_uids": [13], "evidence_quotes": ["轮椅还了，小票我收着"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-13", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 10:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 10:30", "history": []}, "f_0035": {"fact_id": "f_0035", "text": "她爸已在家躺着，惦记晚饭要口软和的", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "她父亲", "evidence_uids": [13], "evidence_quotes": ["他现在在家躺着，就惦记晚饭要口软和的"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-13", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 10:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 10:30", "history": []}, "f_0036": {"fact_id": "f_0036", "text": "她爸今晚在家吃第一顿晚饭，嫌她炖的鲈鱼刺多，念叨了三遍", "subject": "HER", "relation": "她爸出院后在家第一顿晚饭", "evidence_uids": [14], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸在家第一顿晚饭，嫌我炖的鲈鱼刺多，念叨三遍了，跟小时候一个样。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:15", "history": []}, "f_0037": {"fact_id": "f_0037", "text": "她说明天想给甘子川带点东西，让他挑一个", "subject": "HER", "relation": "明天的打算", "evidence_uids": [15], "evidence_quotes": ["明天想给你带点东西，你想吃啥？别说你随便，挑一个。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:15", "history": []}, "f_0038": {"fact_id": "f_0038", "text": "明天带什么还没定，等他挑", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [15, 16], "evidence_quotes": ["明天想给你带点东西，你想吃啥？", "两条鲳鱼放你家门卫了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:15", "valid_to": "2026-11-15 15:30", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:15", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "明天带什么还没定，等他挑", "valid_to": "2026-11-15 15:30", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [16], "quote": "两条鲳鱼放你家门卫了"}]}, "f_0039": {"fact_id": "f_0039", "text": "她妈让两条鲳鱼放在甘子川家门卫，冰袋垫了两层", "subject": "HER", "relation": "送东西", "evidence_uids": [16], "evidence_quotes": ["两条鲳鱼放你家门卫了，冰袋垫了两层"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 15:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:30", "history": []}, "f_0040": {"fact_id": "f_0040", "text": "她爸另加了一袋自己晒的鱼鲞", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "送东西", "evidence_uids": [16], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸非再加一袋他晒的鱼鲞，我拦不住"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 15:30", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:30", "history": []}, "f_0041": {"fact_id": "f_0041", "text": "她今天换药请了半天假陪着", "subject": "HER", "relation": "陪护", "evidence_uids": [17], "evidence_quotes": ["今天换药我请了半天假陪的。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:10", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:10", "history": []}, "f_0042": {"fact_id": "f_0042", "text": "签字那天她手抖，名字签得歪歪扭扭，护士看了一眼没说话", "subject": "HER", "relation": "陪护经历", "evidence_uids": [17], "evidence_quotes": ["签字那天手抖的事一直没跟人说过，名字签得歪歪扭扭，护士看了我一眼，啥也没说。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:10", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:10", "history": []}, "f_0043": {"fact_id": "f_0043", "text": "签字那天走廊里只有她一个人", "subject": "HER", "relation": "陪护经历", "evidence_uids": [18], "evidence_quotes": ["就是那天走廊里就我一个人。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:10", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:10", "history": []}, "f_0044": {"fact_id": "f_0044", "text": "她爸今早自己下楼买了豆浆油条", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家人近况", "evidence_uids": [19], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸今早自己下楼买的豆浆油条"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-16 早上", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 08:45", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 08:45", "history": []}, "f_0045": {"fact_id": "f_0045", "text": "庾医生电话里说她爸恢复得好", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "医嘱", "evidence_uids": [19], "evidence_quotes": ["庾医生电话里说恢复得好"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-16", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 08:45", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 08:45", "history": []}, "f_0046": {"fact_id": "f_0046", "text": "她明天正常上班，欠班组的两个早班周末补回来", "subject": "HER", "relation": "工作安排", "evidence_uids": [19], "evidence_quotes": ["我明天正常上班，欠班组的两个早班周末补回来"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-17 起", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 08:45", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 08:45", "history": []}, "f_0047": {"fact_id": "f_0047", "text": "鲳鱼还放在门卫处，她提醒别放坏", "subject": "HER", "relation": "送的东西", "evidence_uids": [20], "evidence_quotes": ["鲳鱼记得拿，别放坏了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 08:45", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 08:45", "history": []}, "f_0048": {"fact_id": "f_0048", "text": "她认识一个实在的修车保养师傅", "subject": "HER", "relation": "人脉", "evidence_uids": [20], "evidence_quotes": ["回头你车保养，我认识一个实在的师傅"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 08:45", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 08:45", "history": []}, "f_0049": {"fact_id": "f_0049", "text": "回头甘子川车保养，她介绍一个师傅", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [20], "evidence_quotes": ["回头你车保养，我认识一个实在的师傅"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-16 08:45", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-16 08:45", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 49, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0009", "action": "correct", "text": "她请我11月10日早上七点开车到医院北门帮忙搬一箱日用品（原为七点一刻，因手术排第一台提前）", "old_text": "她请我明早七点一刻开车到医院北门帮她搬一箱日用品", "ts": "2026-11-10 07:12", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "你七点来就行"}, {"fact_id": "f_0015", "action": "complete", "text": "她爸十二点零五进手术室，庾医生说两个钟头左右", "old_text": "她爸十二点零五进手术室，庾医生说两个钟头左右", "ts": "2026-11-10 15:35", "src_uids": [5], "quote": "我爸两点十八出来的，庾医生说很顺"}, {"fact_id": "f_0018", "action": "correct", "text": "E区停车场对陪护车辆免费已核实：她妈的车昨天出岗亭未收费", "old_text": "护士站说E区停车场对陪护车辆免费（未核实今天是否适用）", "ts": "2026-11-11 08:25", "src_uids": [9], "quote": "我妈的车昨天停E区，出岗亭没收费"}, {"fact_id": "f_0028", "action": "complete", "text": "庾医生查房说周五能出院", "old_text": "庾医生查房说周五能出院", "ts": "2026-11-13 10:30", "src_uids": [12], "quote": "出院手续办完了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0029", "action": "complete", "text": "出院要办出院小结、医保结算，还要把租的轮椅还到三楼租借处", "old_text": "出院要办出院小结、医保结算，还要把租的轮椅还到三楼租借处", "ts": "2026-11-13 10:30", "src_uids": [13], "quote": "轮椅还了"}, {"fact_id": "f_0038", "action": "complete", "text": "明天带什么还没定，等他挑", "old_text": "明天带什么还没定，等他挑", "ts": "2026-11-15 15:30", "src_uids": [16], "quote": "两条鲳鱼放你家门卫了"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}